1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:02,900
Dzień dobry. Hello everyone.

2
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:05,600
I'm standing on this beautiful bridge.

3
00:00:06,060 --> 00:00:09,400
You can see some love locks on the bridge.

4
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:12,000
This is a very romantic place indeed.

5
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:17,120
We're in Szczytnicki Park,
in a garden called the Japanese Garden.

6
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:22,150
This garden was established in 1916
as part of the exhibition held in this area.

7
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:27,200
It was created together with
Japanese landscape architects.

8
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:32,360
I really recommend visiting.
It's a beautiful garden.

9
00:00:32,620 --> 00:00:37,500
The plants, goldfish and carp in the water
are really amazing.

10
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:41,500
Enjoy the calm and relaxing atmosphere.

11
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,100
Goodbye.
